{"text":{"en":{"\n        <svg class=\"logo-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"17\" stroke=\"#c98a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"8.5\" stroke=\"#4f7fb3\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"33\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"company-name\">\n          [회사명] 베어링\n          <span class=\"sub\">BEARING DISTRIBUTION</span>\n        </span>\n      ":"\n        <svg class=\"logo-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"17\" stroke=\"#c98a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"8.5\" stroke=\"#4f7fb3\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"33\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"company-name\">\n          [Company Name] Bearing\n          <span class=\"sub\">BEARING DISTRIBUTION</span>\n        </span>\n      ","회사소개":"Company","\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#greeting\">인사말</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#history\">연혁</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#directions\">찾아오시는 길</a>\n          ":"\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#greeting\">Greeting</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#history\">History</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#directions\">Directions</a>\n          ","취급제품":"Products","\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#bearing-group\">베어링</a>\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#accessory-group\">부속 부품</a>\n            <a href=\"brands.html\">취급 브랜드</a>\n          ":"\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#bearing-group\">Bearings</a>\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#accessory-group\">Accessory Parts</a>\n            <a href=\"brands.html\">Brands</a>\n          ","규격검색":"Spec Search","고객센터":"Support","\n            <a href=\"notice.html\">공지사항</a>\n            <a href=\"catalog.html\">카탈로그</a>\n            <a href=\"board.html\">견적문의</a>\n          ":"\n            <a href=\"notice.html\">Notices</a>\n            <a href=\"catalog.html\">Catalog</a>\n            <a href=\"board.html\">Quote Inquiry</a>\n          ","\n          <a href=\"board.html\" class=\"btn btn-accent btn-sm\">견적 문의하기</a>\n        ":"\n          <a href=\"board.html\" class=\"btn btn-accent btn-sm\">Request a Quote</a>\n        ","\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Ball Bearing Units · SC Type</p>\n        <h2>SC 시리즈 (압입고정형 인서트)</h2>\n        <p>압입 고정형 SC 인서트 베어링입니다.</p>\n        <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>\n      ":"\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Ball Bearing Units · SC Type</p>\n        <h2>SC Series (Press-Fit Type Insert)</h2>\n        <p>These are press-fit type SC insert bearings.</p>\n        <p class=\"section-head-tip\">You can search by entering just part of the model number or dimensions.</p>\n      ","JIB 공식 카탈로그(제품 개요) 사진 · 구조 단면도(개념도)":"JIB Official Catalog (Product Overview) Photo · Structural Cross-Section Diagram (Conceptual)","\n              <img src=\"img/jib_sc.png\" alt=\"SC 인서트 베어링(압입 고정형)\" style=\"display: block; height: 130px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              <p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #333; margin: 6px 0 0;\">SC <span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-sub);\">(압입 고정형)</span></p>\n            ":"\n              <img src=\"img/jib_sc.png\" alt=\"SC Insert Bearing (Press-Fit Type)\" style=\"display: block; height: 130px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              <p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #333; margin: 6px 0 0;\">SC <span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-sub);\">(Press-Fit Type)</span></p>\n            ","JIB 공식 카탈로그 규격 도면 · ΦD(외경) · Φd(내경) · C(폭) · r(모떼기) · 별도 고정나사 없이 하우징에 압입 고정 · 외형 치수는 6200계열 볼베어링과 동일(JIB 자료)":"JIB Official Catalog Standard Drawing · ΦD (O.D.) · Φd (Bore) · C (Width) · r (Chamfer) · Press-fitted into the housing with no separate locking screw · Outer dimensions are identical to 6200 series ball bearings (per JIB data)","\n          <label for=\"scFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</label>\n          <input id=\"scFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: SC206 또는 30*62\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n        ":"\n          <label for=\"scFilter\">Search by Model / Spec</label>\n          <input id=\"scFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. SC206 or 30*62\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n        ","형번":"Model No.","d(내경)":"d (Bore)","D(외경)":"D (O.D.)","C(폭)":"C (Width)","단위: mm · SWS 카탈로그에 없어 JIB(제일베어링) 공식 카탈로그를 기준으로 작성했습니다.":"Units: mm · Not listed in the SWS catalog, so this was prepared based on the official JIB (Jeil Bearing) catalog.","\n        ※ 형번별 인치 보어(-8, -10 등) 세부 규격은 표에 넣지 않고 대표 미터 보어 규격만 실었습니다. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 당사 정식 규격표 원본으로 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.<br>\n        이 제품군은 ISO 492 일반 허용공차 규격이 적용되지 않는(또는 별도 정밀등급이 적용되는) 품목으로, 공차는 제조사 자체 규격을 따릅니다. 정확한 공차는 발주 전 문의 바랍니다.\n      ":"\n        ※ Detailed specifications for inch bore sizes by model (-8, -10, etc.) are not included in the table; only representative metric bore specifications are listed. Before precision machining or ordering, always perform a final check against our official spec sheet original.<br>\n        This product group is an item to which the general ISO 492 tolerance standard does not apply (or to which a separate precision grade applies); tolerances follow the manufacturer's own standards. Please inquire about exact tolerances before ordering.\n      ","<a href=\"ball_bearing_unit.html\" style=\"color: var(--accent);\">← 볼 베어링 유닛 전체 목록으로</a>":"<a href=\"ball_bearing_unit.html\" style=\"color: var(--accent);\">← Back to Full Ball Bearing Units List</a>","[회사명] BEARING CO.":"[Company Name] BEARING CO.","\n          사업자등록번호 000-00-00000 · 대표 홍길동<br>\n          비공개 (문의 시 안내드립니다)\n        ":"\n          Business Registration No. 000-00-00000 · CEO Hong Gil-dong<br>\n          Not disclosed (available upon inquiry)\n        ","\n        <a href=\"introduce.html\">회사소개</a>\n        <a href=\"about-product.html\">취급제품</a>\n        <a href=\"board.html\">문의</a>\n      ":"\n        <a href=\"introduce.html\">Company</a>\n        <a href=\"about-product.html\">Products</a>\n        <a href=\"board.html\">Contact</a>\n      ","볼 베어링 유닛 SC 시리즈 (압입고정형 인서트) | [회사명] 베어링":"Ball Bearing Unit SC Series (Press-Fit Insert) | [Company Name] Bearing"},"ja":{"\n        <svg class=\"logo-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"17\" stroke=\"#c98a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"8.5\" stroke=\"#4f7fb3\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"33\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"company-name\">\n          [회사명] 베어링\n          <span class=\"sub\">BEARING DISTRIBUTION</span>\n        </span>\n      ":"\n        <svg class=\"logo-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 40\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"17\" stroke=\"#c98a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"20\" r=\"8.5\" stroke=\"#4f7fb3\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"30.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"33\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"26\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n          <circle cx=\"9.5\" cy=\"14\" r=\"2.6\" fill=\"#eef2f6\"></circle>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"company-name\">\n          [会社名] ベアリング\n          <span class=\"sub\">ベアリング販売</span>\n        </span>\n      ","회사소개":"会社紹介","\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#greeting\">인사말</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#history\">연혁</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#directions\">찾아오시는 길</a>\n          ":"\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#greeting\">ごあいさつ</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#history\">沿革</a>\n            <a href=\"introduce.html#directions\">アクセス</a>\n          ","취급제품":"取扱製品","\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#bearing-group\">베어링</a>\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#accessory-group\">부속 부품</a>\n            <a href=\"brands.html\">취급 브랜드</a>\n          ":"\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#bearing-group\">ベアリング</a>\n            <a href=\"about-product.html#accessory-group\">付属部品</a>\n            <a href=\"brands.html\">取扱ブランド</a>\n          ","규격검색":"規格検索","고객센터":"カスタマーセンター","\n            <a href=\"notice.html\">공지사항</a>\n            <a href=\"catalog.html\">카탈로그</a>\n            <a href=\"board.html\">견적문의</a>\n          ":"\n            <a href=\"notice.html\">お知らせ</a>\n            <a href=\"catalog.html\">カタログ</a>\n            <a href=\"board.html\">お見積り依頼</a>\n          ","\n          <a href=\"board.html\" class=\"btn btn-accent btn-sm\">견적 문의하기</a>\n        ":"\n          <a href=\"board.html\" class=\"btn btn-accent btn-sm\">お見積り依頼する</a>\n        ","\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Ball Bearing Units · SC Type</p>\n        <h2>SC 시리즈 (압입고정형 인서트)</h2>\n        <p>압입 고정형 SC 인서트 베어링입니다.</p>\n        <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>\n      ":"\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">Ball Bearing Units · SC Type</p>\n        <h2>SCシリーズ(圧入固定形インサート)</h2>\n        <p>圧入固定形の SCインサートベアリングです。</p>\n        <p class=\"section-head-tip\">型番または寸法の一部を入力するだけで検索できます。</p>\n      ","JIB 공식 카탈로그(제품 개요) 사진 · 구조 단면도(개념도)":"JIB公式カタログ(製品概要)写真・構造断面図(概念図)","\n              <img src=\"img/jib_sc.png\" alt=\"SC 인서트 베어링(압입 고정형)\" style=\"display: block; height: 130px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              <p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #333; margin: 6px 0 0;\">SC <span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-sub);\">(압입 고정형)</span></p>\n            ":"\n              <img src=\"img/jib_sc.png\" alt=\"SCインサートベアリング(圧入固定形)\" style=\"display: block; height: 130px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              <p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #333; margin: 6px 0 0;\">SC <span style=\"font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-sub);\">(圧入固定形)</span></p>\n            ","JIB 공식 카탈로그 규격 도면 · ΦD(외경) · Φd(내경) · C(폭) · r(모떼기) · 별도 고정나사 없이 하우징에 압입 고정 · 외형 치수는 6200계열 볼베어링과 동일(JIB 자료)":"JIB公式カタログ規格図面・ΦD(外径)・Φd(内径)・C(幅)・r(面取り)・別途固定ねじなしでハウジングに圧入固定・外形寸法は6200シリーズ玉軸受と同一(JIB資料)","\n          <label for=\"scFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</label>\n          <input id=\"scFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: SC206 또는 30*62\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n        ":"\n          <label for=\"scFilter\">型番 / 規格検索</label>\n          <input id=\"scFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"例: SC206 または 30*62\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n        ","형번":"型番","d(내경)":"d（内径）","D(외경)":"D（外径）","C(폭)":"C（幅）","단위: mm · SWS 카탈로그에 없어 JIB(제일베어링) 공식 카탈로그를 기준으로 작성했습니다.":"単位: mm・SWSカタログに記載がないため、JIB(第一ベアリング)公式カタログを基準に作成しました。","\n        ※ 형번별 인치 보어(-8, -10 등) 세부 규격은 표에 넣지 않고 대표 미터 보어 규격만 실었습니다. 정밀 가공·발주 전에는 반드시 당사 정식 규격표 원본으로 최종 확인하시기 바랍니다.<br>\n        이 제품군은 ISO 492 일반 허용공차 규격이 적용되지 않는(또는 별도 정밀등급이 적용되는) 품목으로, 공차는 제조사 자체 규격을 따릅니다. 정확한 공차는 발주 전 문의 바랍니다.\n      ":"\n        ※ 形番別のインチボア(-8, -10など)の詳細規格は表に含めておらず、代表的なメートルボア規格のみ掲載しています。精密加工・発注前には必ず当社正式規格表の原本で最終確認してください。<br>\n        この製品群はISO 492一般許容公差規格が適用されない(または別途精密等級が適用される)品目であり、公差はメーカー固有の規格に従います。正確な公差は発注前にお問い合わせください。\n      ","<a href=\"ball_bearing_unit.html\" style=\"color: var(--accent);\">← 볼 베어링 유닛 전체 목록으로</a>":"<a href=\"ball_bearing_unit.html\" style=\"color: var(--accent);\">← ボールベアリングユニット一覧に戻る</a>","[회사명] BEARING CO.":"[会社名] BEARING CO.","\n          사업자등록번호 000-00-00000 · 대표 홍길동<br>\n          비공개 (문의 시 안내드립니다)\n        ":"\n          事業者登録番号 000-00-00000 ・ 代表 ホン・ギルドン<br>\n          非公開（お問い合わせ時にご案内します）\n        ","\n        <a href=\"introduce.html\">회사소개</a>\n        <a href=\"about-product.html\">취급제품</a>\n        <a href=\"board.html\">문의</a>\n      ":"\n        <a href=\"introduce.html\">会社紹介</a>\n        <a href=\"about-product.html\">取扱製品</a>\n        <a href=\"board.html\">お問い合わせ</a>\n      ","볼 베어링 유닛 SC 시리즈 (압입고정형 인서트) | [회사명] 베어링":"玉軸受ユニット SCシリーズ（圧入固定形インサート） | [会社名] ベアリング"},"zh":{"\n        <svg class=\